<div class="rv-page">
    <div class="inv-page-head">
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0">
            <div class="inv-title">Review Summary</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding-top:4px">Everything captured across the four steps &middot; check before submission</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);flex:none">Application No: <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)">FBBMFL26F99AAC1</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="rv-ready laptop-only">
        <div class="rv-ready__text"><strong>Every control point has passed.</strong> All three holders are identified from CKYC and consented under DPDP, every proof of address is verified against source including holder 1&rsquo;s mailing-address proof, face match passed for each holder, the payment cheque matched the account on file, and no field the broker owns is blank. <span class="rv-em">The declarations below are the only thing left.</span></div>
        <div class="rv-ready__status">Ready to submit</div>
    </div>

    @* ── Fixed deposit ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
    <section class="rv-section laptop-only">
        <div class="rv-head">
            <div class="rv-head__text">
                <div class="rv-head__title">Fixed deposit</div>
                <div class="rv-head__desc">Rate is the card rate for a 36-month public deposit as on 14 Sep 2026 &middot; locked on realisation of the cheque, not on submission</div>
            </div>
            <a class="rv-head__action" asp-controller="Application" asp-action="FdConfiguration">Edit on 10</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rv-grid-4">
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Invested amount</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">&#8377; 5,00,000</div><div class="rv-kv__note">five lakh rupees</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Category</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">Public</div><div class="rv-kv__note">no senior-citizen uplift &mdash; youngest holder is 30</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Scheme</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">Cumulative</div><div class="rv-kv__note">from tenure and payout together</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Rate of interest</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg rv-kv__v--green">7.85% p.a.</div><div class="rv-kv__note">card rate &middot; not negotiable</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Tenure</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">36 months</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Interest payout</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">On maturity</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Maturity value</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">&#8377; 6,29,300</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Matures on</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">14 Sep 2029</div><div class="rv-kv__note">36 months from realisation</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="rv-grid-4 rv-grid-4--divided">
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Auto renewal</div><div class="rv-kv__v">On &middot; principal only</div><div class="rv-kv__note">at the card rate on 14 Sep 2029</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">TDS</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--amber">Not deducted &mdash; exemption claimed</div><div class="rv-kv__note">Form 15G on file for the primary holder</div></div>
            <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Delivery type</div><div class="rv-kv__v">E-receipt</div><div class="rv-kv__note rv-wrap">TERSESHIVAPRASAD@ICLOUD.COM</div></div>
