            </div>
            <div class="rv-grid-2">
                <div><div class="rv-kv__k">Payment account</div><div class="rv-kv__v rv-kv__v--lg">HDFC Bank &bull;&bull;&bull;&bull;4471</div><div class="rv-kv__note">Andheri East, Mumbai &middot; IFSC HDFC0000521 &middot; MICR 400240015</div></div>
